//! The `rule-break` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets the behavior for breaking column and row rules into segments where rows and column
//! gaps intersect, setting `column-rule-break` and `row-rule-break` to the same value.
